WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.500
(Test caption) The morning starts with the same small noise.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Thirty-two seconds, every day,
like a clock that hums.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.500
I count them without meaning to.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.500
The mirror is too close to see anything.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.500
(Test caption) End.
